t..ttttt...A...ttttt..t
tt..ttt........tttt..tt
 tt..t....c+c...tt..tt
  tt....cccDccc....tt
   tt...cHDDDHc...tt
    t..ccDDDDDcc..t
    tA.+DDDFDDD+.At
    t..ccDDDDDcc..t
   tt...cHDDDHc...tt
  tt....cccDccc....tt
 tt..tt...c+c....t..tt
tt..tttt........ttt..tt
t..ttttt...A...ttttt..t
tEttttt..ttttt..tttttEt
tttttt..tt   tt..tttttt
   tt..tt     tt..tt
